# Final ConceptSMILE implementation

This directory is reserved for the final implementation corresponding to the
submitted ConceptSMILE manuscript.

The final implementation should follow the experimental protocol reported in
the manuscript, including:

- four retinal datasets: HRF, APTOS 2019, ODIR-5K, and IDRiD;
- 10 selected images per dataset (40 images in total);
- three retinal concepts: lesion, blood vessels, and optic disc;
- SLIC superpixels with target segments = 7;
- 50 unique binary superpixel perturbations per image;
- exclusion of the all-masked perturbation;
- black masking of removed superpixels;
- `facebook/dinov2-base` CLS-token embeddings for locality computation;
- cosine and Wasserstein distance;
- exponential locality weighting;
- a fixed structured JSON prompt for the VLM pathway; and
- XGBoost as the local surrogate model.

The historical exploratory notebooks remain in `../legacy/` and are retained
for provenance. They should not be interpreted as the final manuscript
implementation.

Final experiment notebooks, configuration, image manifests, and result files
will be added here only when they can be verified against the experiments
reported in the manuscript.
